  "instructions": [
    "In a medium saucepan, bring the chicken broth and water to a boil over high heat.",
    "Add the bulgur, fennel seeds, salt, black pepper, cumin, coriander, and paprika. ",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes, or until the bulgur is tender.",
    "Stir in the honey, lemon juice, and olive oil.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a large serving bowl.",
    "Drizzle with additional honey, if desired.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve warm.",
    "Refrigerate leftovers for up to 3 days.",
    "To aerate the bulgur, use a whisk or fork to fluff it before serving."
  ],
